# FieldBehavior - what a field does that is not markup, put INSIDE its Field (after the control):
#   kind "money"  → separates thousands when leaving the field (25000 → 25.000)
#   kind "email"  → checks the address when leaving the field (not while typing); the error replaces the help text
#                   in the same place (nothing jumps). message = the error.
#   kind "search" → Esc clears it.
#   kind "count"  → «71/160» at the end of the description line (needs maxlength via `max`).
#   Field(label: "Correo para avisos", description: "Te llegan las reservas nuevas.") { Input(value: mail)  FieldBehavior(kind: "email", message: "Falta algo: revisa que sea como nombre@dominio.co") }
# shadcn-for-muten · Custom · host JS is field-behavior.js.
part FieldBehavior(kind: text, message: text = "", max: number = 0) { Custom FieldBehavior inputs(kind: $kind, message: $message, max: $max) class("cx-field-behavior") }
